---
/**
 * Replaces Starlight's ThemeProvider. The documentation is light only, like
 * the landing page (src/DESIGN.md defines no dark palette), so the theme is
 * pinned instead of read from the reader's system or a stored choice.
 */
---

{/* Inlined so the page never paints in Starlight's dark default. */}
<script is:inline>
  document.documentElement.dataset.theme = 'light';
</script>
